        "content": "## Stripe test refunds with Allowly 0.2.1\nRead examples/stripe-refund-with-approval.md first.\nSelect Allowly API credentials on all Allowly nodes and Fetch decision receipt. Select the SAME Stripe TEST credential on both Stripe HTTP nodes. Set Header Auth on Wait for reviewer.\nCreate/store authorization once. Configure Refund request. Only USD test payments run. Review body: {\"approved\":true,\"resource\":\"EXACT RESOURCE FROM Validate request\"}. Four-minute timeout stops.\nRefund result is available even if receipt retrieval fails. Pending receipts are not signed or verified. Never change the request ID to retry an uncertain refund.",
